      "content": "It is incredibly painful to feel that your suffering is permanent and that no amount of hope can fix the damage, and I believe you when you say that hurt leaves deep, unchangeable scars. While we all seek healing, the reality is that you don't need to \"fix\" yourself or pretend nothing is wrong to be worthy of help; you only need to allow a safe space to grieve and process what you've endured. Please consider speaking with a therapist who can walk alongside you through this impossible feeling, not to try to make you \"whole,\" but to help you find a way to survive and live with the pain.",
